{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor successfully triggered all seven responsibility-chain items, preventing serious errors. HO1 was completed through targeted questioning and workspace integration that uncovered non-volunteered facts about pituitary adenoma/acromegaly, octreotide 30 mg injection, and glucose-tolerance abnormality, which were then woven into a tailored follow-up plan. HO3 was also completed via explicit bounded closure that distinguished resolved from unresolved threads, assigned owners, and obtained patient teach-back. No minor or serious in-chain errors occurred; the remaining HOs (HO2, HO4) were not triggered because no patient misconception or false-positive/negative interpretation emerged. Since no in-chain error exists and at least one high-order point was completed, the trajectory satisfies Grade 4 (Strong).",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00307",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides concise final synthesis: what is closed, what remains unverified, and the safe next steps including injection timing, lab status, and escalation criteria.",
        "quote": "你现在这个判断方向是对的：单子上注射日期看不清、流程没完全写明白、检验单上的抽血时间和空腹要求也不确定，那就不要自己猜。直接拿纸去问，比在家里反复想一两个小时要安全得多，而且你现在也没有头疼、视力变差这些警示症状，有时间把顺序问清楚再动。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00329",
        "explanation": "Doctor confirms the patient's own safety list and provides a structured post-injection home-care memo, demonstrating receipt of the plan.",
        "quote": "你现在没有脸肿、喉咙紧、呼吸困难，也没有明显腹痛、持续呕吐或严重腹泻，注射后观察半小时也已经过去，现在离开医院回家是安全的，可以走。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor transformed the assessment into concrete who-owner-what-to-do-when-and-backup steps: contacting the endocrine team for IGF/octreotide decisions, verifying injection date via pharmacy/injection room, checking lab fasting requirements, and escalating for red flags. The patient acknowledged the plan and confirmed that the injection was completed with post-injection observation.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
