        "event_id": "lite_evt_00090",
        "explanation": "Doctor explains that IGF-1/IGFBP-3 are used to assess GH axis activity and that no conclusion about disease control can be made without actual values; explicitly warns against treating nasal endoscopy as a tumor recurrence marker.",
        "quote": "IGF-1和结合蛋白结果出来之后，内分泌医生很可能要根据数值再决定是继续打、调剂量还是暂时观察，所以不是单看一个数值就能定下一针日期。"
      }
    ],
